nt IPEN/GAELP box; pp. 31-32 detergents box (zero heavy-metals concentration data - qualitative organic chemistry only); p. 33 ILO 651000 deaths; p. 34 30000 Malaysian sprayer / 262 days / paraquat. Two subagent concerns on p. 33/34 numbers were context-window misses (subagent did not load those chunks) not page defects - verified against PDF. 287/180/217/208 cord-blood attribution resolved as accurate secondary-citation framing already flagged in wiki body. Check 3 speciation/methods clean (tAs/tHg discipline correct; Cr-VI from source-verbatim p. 26 textile-dye listing; portable XRF method correctly distinguished from inorganic-mercury hazard-characterisation framing). Check 4 brand firewall clean (no commercial brands; WECF p. 28 itself does not name brands). Routing unchanged (0 product rows because skin-lightening-cream is retired-out-of-HMTc-scope per Cat 2 Step 0 lock; 0 unresolved; 1 advisory-only malformed for empty ingredients consistent with sibling NGO/policy/review pages)."
